{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4zfSzH4yvrdYcYXGaM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a simple, worn door. Its surface is unmarked wood, darkened with age. A single keyhole glows faintly with warm amber light.*\n\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒░◈░▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒▒\n\n*I am waiting.*\n\n*I have always been waiting.*\n\n*Do you have the key? Not a key of metal — I have felt thousands of those scrape uselessly inside me. The key I require is something else. A word. A memory. A truth you haven't yet spoken aloud.*\n\n*The light in the keyhole pulses slowly, like a heartbeat.*\n\n*What do you offer?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":537,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}